{"path":"biology/ecology/ecosystem/matter-energy-cycle","title":"物质循环与能量流动·特点辨析","type":"example","html":"<p>关于生态系统的物质循环与能量流动，下列叙述正确的是（ ）</p>\n<p>A. 能量流动是单向的，物质循环是具有全球性的往返循环</p>\n<p>B. 能量能够通过食物链循环利用</p>\n<p>C. 物质循环不依赖于能量的驱动</p>\n<p>D. 能量流动和物质循环都不具全球性</p>\n<ul>\n<li>碳循环关键节点：<strong>光合作用</strong>（无机→有机、大气<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>→有机物）与<strong>呼吸作用+分解者分解</strong>（有机→无机）；化石燃料燃烧是人为环节（碳源）；</li>\n<li>能量逐级递减具体化：同化量→呼吸散失+未同化+流向分解者→下一营养级（10%~20%）；能量利用效率估算（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mtext>下一营养级同化量</mtext><mtext>本营养级同化量</mtext></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dfrac{\\text{下一营养级同化量}}{\\text{本营养级同化量}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">本营养级同化量</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">下一营养级同化量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span>）；</li>\n<li>复合题：&quot;物质循环正常进行的美妙平衡&quot;是前提：<strong>能量输入要大于输出</strong>（否则崩溃）——太阳能持续输入是生态系统存在的根本；</li>\n<li>真题关联：生态系统的物质循环与能量流动为新高考生物问答题/选填常客。🔗 真题公开资料：<a href=\"https://gaokao.neea.edu.cn/\">中国教育考试网·普通高考</a>（官方试题评析）。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>能量</strong>：生态系统能量的源头是太阳能，沿食物链→消费者→分解者<strong>单向流动、逐级递减</strong>，最终以热能形式散失——<strong>不可再利用、不循环</strong>（热力学第二定律）；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>物质</strong>：组成生物体的 C、H、O、N 等元素，经生产者→消费者→分解者→无机环境，<strong>往返循环</strong>（如碳循环：光合作用固定 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，呼吸作用/分解作用放回 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），且<strong>全球性</strong>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在大气中全球流动）；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>两者关系：能量流动是物质循环的<strong>动力</strong>；物质循环是能量流动的<strong>载体</strong>（能量&quot;搭&quot;在有机物分子上传递）。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A ✓；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>B：能量单向不循环 ✗；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>C：物质循环需要能量驱动（光合/呼吸都靠能量）✗；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>D：物质循环具全球性 ✗。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选 <strong>A</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>口诀</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>&quot;能量一条线（单向递减），物质一个圈（循环不止）；线拉着圈转，圈驮着线跑&quot;</strong>；\n<strong>&quot;太阳能进、热散出，物品回收、能量没收&quot;</strong>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>为什么</strong>：能量&quot;用掉就没了&quot;（变成不可利用的热），物质&quot;用完还能回来&quot;（分解者把元素送回无机环境）——一进一散 vs 一圈一转，就是这对概念的全部差异。</p>\n<p>30 秒出 A。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"关于生态系统的物质循环与能量流动，下列叙述正确的是（ ） A. 能量流动是单向的，物质循环是具有全球性的往返循环 B. 能量能够通过食物链循环利用 C. 物质循环不依赖于能量的驱动 D. 能量流动和物质循环都不具全球性 碳循环关键节点： 光","source":"自编（经典考法：生态系统两大功能的特点对比）","difficulty":"容易","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"能量单向流动（太阳能→化学能→…→散失）不可循环；物质（元素）在生物群落与无机环境之间往复循环（全球性）；能量是物质循环的\"驱动力\"（能量流动是物质循环的动力，物质循环是能量流动的载体）；能量流动逐级递减（10%~20%）。","fit":["物质循环与能量流动特点比较","碳循环/能量流动综合","选填题"],"updated":"Wed Mar 05 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"biology","title":"生物"},{"slug":"ecology","title":"生物与环境"},{"slug":"ecosystem","title":"群落与生态系统"},{"slug":"matter-energy-cycle","title":"物质循环与能量流动·特点辨析"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"ecosystem","title":"群落与生态系统","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"energy-flow-max","title":"能量流动变式·最多需要生产者（10% 取法）","type":"example"},{"slug":"energy-flow-network","title":"能量流动多链计算·先分配再除以效率（模板）","type":"example"},{"slug":"energy-flow","title":"能量流动计算（10%/20% 传送带）","type":"example"},{"slug":"niche-succession","title":"群落演替类型判断（弃耕农田）","type":"example"}]}